menu "LED Package Configuration"

config PACKAGE_LED
    bool "Enable System Status LED Module"
    default y
    help
      开启此选项以将 LED 模块编译进内核。

config PACKAGE_LED_AUTO_BLINK
    bool "Enable Auto Blinking in Background"
    default y
    depends on PACKAGE_LED
    help
      如果开启，LED 模块将在后台自动闪烁，不阻塞主线程。

config PACKAGE_LED_BLINK_INTERVAL
    int "LED Blink Interval (ms)"
    default 500
    depends on PACKAGE_LED_AUTO_BLINK
    help
      设置自动闪烁的间隔时间（毫秒）。

endmenu